<title>USA: Scitex Corp Ltd names CFO.</title>
<headline>Scitex Corp Ltd names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scitex Corp Ltd said Thursday it had named Eyal Desheh corporate vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Desheh was vice president for business development and strategy at Israel's telephone operating company, Bezeq.</p>
<p>Desheh succeeds Giora Bitan, who announced his resignation from the Herzlia, Israel-based company in mid-September.</p>
